example {
  name: Add brand
  description: Creates a new brand under a specific sub-category. A brand represents a company or product line like "Apple", "Samsung", "Sony", etc. Each brand must belong to a sub-category and category, have a unique name, and include a logo image. The system automatically generates a slug and verifies that the sub-category exists under the correct parent category before creating the brand.
  
